## Memory

- `.agents/memory/decisions.md`: append-only ADR log of meaningful technical decisions. Grep it for the topic and read only the matching ADRs, so settled questions aren't re-litigated; never read the whole log.
- `.agents/memory/lessons.md`: append-only retro log. One paragraph per session. Compounds over time.
- `.agents/memory/learning-log.md`: append-only study log: topic, verified facts with sources, follow-ups.

When in doubt about a past decision, grep `decisions.md` first.

## Rules

Cross-cutting rules live in `.agents/rules/`. Claude Code loads each file-scoped one through a thin `.claude/rules/<topic>.md` adapter when a matching file is read or edited; other agents read the source before working on those paths.

- `commands.md`: commands the agent may run without asking.
- `env-and-secrets.md`: environment variables and secrets.
<!-- kit:if has.container -->
- `production-parity.md`: the differences between development and the production container.
<!-- kit:end -->

